            { "role": "assistant", "text": "Two things, one of them a level away.\n\n- At **34** you can train **Mage Armor**. In Forever it keeps 50% of your mana regeneration going while you cast, up from 30% in Classic Era, and adds 5 resistance to all magic. Use it instead of Frost Armor while you quest.\n- You already have **Evocation**: 8 seconds of mana regeneration raised by 1500%, every 8 minutes. Save it for the pull that would otherwise make you stop and drink.", "at": 1790967780 }
